ctive Switching:</strong> Experience the tension from every angle—switch seamlessly between 3rd and 1st person views to fully immerse yourself in the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anime-Style 3D Graphics:</strong> Dive into a world that combines stunning visuals with a deeply atmospheric setting, creating a perfect blend of beauty and dread.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you help Kasuga escape the nightmare... or will you succumb to it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p>", "short_description": "High School Dirty Secrets is a horror/puzzle adventure where Kasuga wakes up locked inside her high school with no memory of how she got there. As she searches for a way out, strange and unsettling events unfold, leading her to uncover dark secrets hidden within the school's walls.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115490/9d88081c61f413b4ebe80f6a0dac400ad5c7c608/header.jpg?t=1765016994", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115490/a89b3bbb6c7a62576a367463325e8b4cbef81b3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765016994", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115490/a89b3bbb6c7a62576a367463325e8b4cbef81b3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765016994", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3570K or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 780 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>